    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:1a778ad11952af9440bb97e47350b26711010cc86bae29e75f161a72289d50aa",
      "request_id": "1a778ad11952af9440bb97e47350b26711010cc86bae29e75f161a72289d50aa",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ae70cf7ea4d0e650b31c1a49f056480c",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "印第安维尔斯、迈阿密，她都止步8强，两次负于莱巴金娜。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "19397e61fe7452fb55873edc92afc4fe64af5c8005231d9faf9e1280e0da8e4a",
      "words_sha256": "0238320301a80d8174aa49df93c1b8ea8ec8de08b379e2601cfbfbe95e9a710a"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:4b2bf9126fd0d1fc5ff3dc236dc1178cf031c11cfc83ff44b8ef44959915f43f",
      "request_id": "4b2bf9126fd0d1fc5ff3dc236dc1178cf031c11cfc83ff44b8ef44959915f43f",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "3a4e642fb19747689e8401c5a6066394",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "到了查尔斯顿，她连打四场三盘，撑进决赛。决赛六比二、六比二击败斯塔罗杜布采娃，拿到本赛季第二冠。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "e6dcd74a072d6eb0a03920e2d74e817497f06e2ac8299ac1711769eb291aef41",
      "words_sha256": "2e5976fa82ebdb8d45c40eb1f302588365e1aa5881fd3950f857a648879a7dac"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:6a5b3d44ff9bf2732edf64597e40b3b9c0c60738638dd62d4f14e65c2c21ab5f",
      "request_id": "6a5b3d44ff9bf2732edf64597e40b3b9c0c60738638dd62d4f14e65c2c21ab5f",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d3448f6cb3f3b75d9474efb36c7e5650",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零二四年，她也拿过辛辛那提亚军。今年两座冠军、三次亚军，佩古拉也经历过法网首轮出局。她的这张年终门票，要从一月说起。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "10e0a26f89170cfa3e41fe191ec1a00ff6bbe880ef73fbde23dcffd9965b8855",
      "words_sha256": "f6aee33dd3f8ecef915bdb076e141e4abddbbc78fcb64dbdecd53281ed43ff72"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:797e5acd3aba22aeed5192c54933293f6f43a44693fe245c5b255ab902b6723c",
      "request_id": "797e5acd3aba22aeed5192c54933293f6f43a44693fe245c5b255ab902b6723c",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "03825b7231e5e7acf4a97112ebb4661a",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "十月十四日，WTA正式确认她连续第五年入围年终。门票来自一整年的积累，武汉这一场失利，也留在她的赛季记录里。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "d5093fb6593d31bb576540b7636b015d28d4dbeccec6e5b0bda0ff30036f1040",
      "words_sha256": "3421d5c39a07fffd57860e339311ad4aabc17b0e66b14142e81d1863b1fa4618"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:848872b6020a68721add77372367a87fd89272d023703e19dc99eef9a862454a",
      "request_id": "848872b6020a68721add77372367a87fd89272d023703e19dc99eef9a862454a",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "87d964f7e5d588241a03961d928e51db",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "美网，她逆转费尔南德斯和纳瓦罗，今年第二次拿到大满贯4强。赢下纳瓦罗后，她谈到那些消极的念头。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "de1afb10980cf1870fd4f7488b3ab7d89217fb75c30bf525ce48cf09f7098312",
      "words_sha256": "d4bffd3290e48fccf923e1c2fee3528988100ab1717cf93ffa23e386336a65dd"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:a34a659f38dd2c392330199e91768bc28ba56043baa64361410cb9917f201389",
      "request_id": "a34a659f38dd2c392330199e91768bc28ba56043baa64361410cb9917f201389",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b64eda6b9040c5c944fe1406b0059b0d",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "草地赛季，她在伯林半决赛的决胜盘送给萨巴伦卡一个六比零。决赛负于诺斯科娃，取得亚军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "dd2003e30b12649c2133bd1661f9d53a239baeb06160bf2da2d1d100811d3158",
      "words_sha256": "fa36504169d8bd1114c8be1ab0880ec7f2ff2a2be72fb0f7b6f497a1285f212c"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:a6913af0046d3c2973fb2ebf57b4136d355a57b6bb3a9d240e77ac93c951bd50",
      "request_id": "a6913af0046d3c2973fb2ebf57b4136d355a57b6bb3a9d240e77ac93c951bd50",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "192bb31a8c9107fefcb54029a70e7304",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "温网，她先赢一盘，仍被高芙逆转，止步8强。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "9d3fbaa8d7674137857dfebcb4c6aee8fab3571d68173d1717040496bd07b041",
      "words_sha256": "c314a8771e33532e776f8fbd202eba023f5c318e3d4189aaa389285e9fc1c310"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:a714f9cf14235e370adbe9e66de2ca4fddb2ebf41d405cbc77d0f235be1f74ba",
      "request_id": "a714f9cf14235e370adbe9e66de2ca4fddb2ebf41d405cbc77d0f235be1f74ba",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "cb8c37eac35256ac37e0855421073cb4",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "布里斯班打进4强，澳网也进4强。墨尔本，她连胜凯斯和阿尼西莫娃，半决赛两盘负于莱巴金娜。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "89efad7179b51cb28a48bd79c3943160fdb903b1bf9f70c0ed27722ab9b19636",
      "words_sha256": "89c5b58ecffa426d48362424f14b7673e707ce701d691c47c837a72b98a29e13"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request_id": "b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "7a3a0a50808c47121774d198c34f84ccc9670bff740e06aacde9ed15be30987f",
      "words_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8"
    },
    {
