        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二月来到迪拜。半决赛先丢一盘，她连追两盘击败阿尼西莫娃。决赛六比二、六比四战胜斯维托丽娜，拿到本赛季第一冠。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "08b839ac6a41c7e28a514e83a22101ea68a42fca604032f9f4ca73aabd732b3a",
      "words_sha256": "08534af0198e296c269f2188b5ea0ebb50d06dd00ae4cabc7afc0cf429488445"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:c9496a775265057dd017109669037638574fc723f26ed90f61be9e182ab30cba",
      "request_id": "c9496a775265057dd017109669037638574fc723f26ed90f61be9e182ab30cba",
