        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "美网之后，她退出新加坡和北京；武汉首战，三个赛点未兑现，仍被奥斯塔彭科逆转。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "75464f2f30abdcf100ec6a5e96f8df930a1fb83322a7a5d2ac72318a0ccc3afc",
