        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "华盛顿亚军，多伦多止步第四轮。辛辛那提，她连赢三场三盘，今年第五次进决赛，最终又输给高芙。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "b4814a76bedc2cab96bd7ab2b182d4768a52818739b23378e5d5892649deaf16",
